\description{
Goalie lines of one match, one row per goalie who played.

Wraps \verb{GET https://s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/icehl.hokejovyzapis.cz/matches/\{match_id\}/top-goalies.json} of the ICE Hockey League eSports bucket. Example: \url{https://s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/icehl.hokejovyzapis.cz/matches/8161/top-goalies.json}.
Seasons are END years (2027 = 2026/27); every request waits at least one second after
the last one to the same host.
}
